#: kcmtaskbar.cpp:144
msgid ""
"<h1>Taskbar</h1> You can configure the taskbar here. This includes options "
"such as whether or not the taskbar should show all windows at once or only "
"those on the current desktop. You can also configure whether or not the "
"Window List button will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Bår des bouyes</h1> Vos ploz apontyî l' bår des bouyes chal. Çoula "
"comprind des tchuzes come est çk' i fåt mostrer totes les finiesses ou "
"seulmint les cisse do scribanne do moumint. Vos ploz eto apontyî s' i fåt ou "
"nén mostrer l' boton pol djivêye des fniesses."

