#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:16
#. i18n: ectx: property (windowTitle), widget (QWidget)
#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:32
#. i18n: ectx: property (title), widget (QButtonGroup)
#: rc.cpp:5 rc.cpp:8
msgid "Taskbar"
msgstr "Bår des bouyes"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:47
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:11
msgid "Show windows from all sc&reens"
msgstr "Mostrer les fniesses di totes les &waitroûles"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:55
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:14
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> "
"windows which are on the same Xinerama screen as the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Dismete cisse tchuze ci frè ki vosse bår des bouyes va <b>seulmint</b> "
"mostrer les fniesses ki sont sol minme waitroûle Xinerama ki l' bår des "
"bouyes.\n"
"\n"
"Li prémetowe dujhance c' est d' aveur cisse tchuze la metowe et d' mostrer "
"totes les fniesses."

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:63
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Sort windows by desk&top"
msgstr "Relére les fniesses pa &scribanne"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:71
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:22
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to show windows in order of the "
"desktop they appear on.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezi cisse tchuze ci fwait ki l' bår des bouyes mosterrè les fniesses "
"d' après l' ôre des scribannes k' i sont dvins.\n"
"\n"
"Li prémetowe dujhance c' est d' aveur cisse tchuze ci metowe."

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:96
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:27
msgid "&Show windows from all desktops"
msgstr "Mostrer les fniesses di &tos les scribannes"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:104
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:30
msgid ""
"Turning this option off will cause the taskbar to display <b>only</b> the "
"windows on the current desktop. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is selected and all windows are shown."
msgstr ""
"Dismete cisse tchuze ci frè ki vosse bår des bouyes va <b>seulmint</b> "
"mostrer les fniesses ki sont sol minme sicribanne ki l' ci do moumint.\n"
"\n"
"Li prémetowe dujhance c' est d' aveur cisse tchuze la metowe et d' mostrer "
"totes les fniesses."

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:112
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:35
msgid "Sho&w application icons"
msgstr "Mostrer les &imådjetes des programes"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:120
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:38
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want window icons to appear along with their "
"titles in the taskbar.\n"
"\n"
"By default this option is selected."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz çouchal si vos vloz k' les imådjetes des programes soeyexhe "
"håynêyes adlé des tites dins l' bår des bouyes.\n"
"\n"
"Li prémetowe dujhance c' est d' aveur cisse tchuze ci metowe."

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:128
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:43
msgid "Show window list &button"
msgstr "Mostrer l' &boton pol djivêye des fniesses"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:134
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:46
msgid ""
"Selecting this option causes the taskbar to display a button that, when "
"clicked, shows a list of all windows in a popup menu."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezi cisse tchuze ci fwait ki l' bår des bouyes mosterrè on boton ki, "
"cwand il est clitchî, mostere èn aspitant menu avou ene djivêye di totes les "
"fniesses k' i gn a."

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:142
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:49
msgid "Show o&nly minimized windows"
msgstr "Mostrer &seulmint les fniesses å pus ptit"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:147
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox)
#: rc.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Select this option if you want the taskbar to display <b>only</b> minimized "
"windows. \n"
"\n"
"By default, this option is not selected and the taskbar will show all "
"windows."
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz çouchal si vos vloz kel bår des bouyes håynêye <b>seulmint</b> "
"les fniesses ki sont metous å pus ptit.\n"
"\n"
"Li prémetowe dujhance c' est d' aveur cisse tchuze la dismetowe et "
"d' mostrer totes les fniesses."

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:155
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel)
#: rc.cpp:57
msgid "&Group similar tasks:"
msgstr "Mete &eshonne les rshonnantès bouyes:"

#. i18n: file: kcmtaskbarui.ui:178
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QComboBox)
#: rc.cpp:60
msgid ""
"The taskbar can group similar windows into single buttons. When one of these "
"window group buttons are clicked on a menu appears showing all the windows "
"in that group. This can be especially useful with the <em>Show all windows</"
"em> option.\n"
"\n"
"You can set the taskbar to <strong>Never</strong> group windows, to "
"<strong>Always</strong> group windows or to group windows only <strong>When "
"the Taskbar is Full</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"By default the taskbar groups windows when it is full."
msgstr ""
"Li bår des bouyes pout mete eshonne dins on minme boton les fniesses "
"rishonnantes. Cwand onk di ces botons ki rashonne sacwantès fniesses est "
"clitchî, on menu aparexhe ki mostere totes les fniesses do groupe. Çoula "
"pout esse ahessåve avou l' tchuze <em>Mostrer totes les fniesses</em>.\n"
"\n"
"Vos ploz apontyî l' bår des bouyes po n' <strong>Måy</strong> mete les "
"fniesses eshonne, pol <strong>Tofer</strong> fé, ou co po nel fé ki "
"<strong>Cwand l' bår des bouyes est plinne</strong>.\n"
"\n"
"Li prémetowe dujhance c' est d' mete les fniesses eshonne cwand l' bår des "
"bouyes est plinte."

